    <string name="safety_title">Before you use CrossWise</string>
    <string name="safety_body">CrossWise is an aid, not a replacement for your cane, guide dog, orientation and mobility skills, or your own judgment. It can miss or misread signals and vehicles, especially at night, in rain, or when the view is blocked. It never tells you that it is safe to cross. Test it with a sighted helper before relying on it.</string>
